{
 "note": "Hotline Connect Client 1.9.1 (Hotline Communications, 2003): the classic PowerPC build (HLclient19.Classic, InterfaceLib + Open Transport) and the Carbon one, expanded by StuffIt Expander in the guest. Its tracker list (Data:Hotline Prefs, which both builds read) gets ten trackers beside hltracker.com's, gathered 2026-11-01 from hlwiki, preterhuman and the Hotline fandom wiki, not probed",
 "kind": "expand",
 "archive": "HotlineConnectClient192.sit_.bin",
 "expect": [
  "HotlineConnectClient-Mac"
 ],
 "launch": [
  "HotlineConnectClient-Mac:HLclient19.Classic",
  "HotlineConnectClient-Mac:HotlineClient(M-Carbon)"
 ],
